01:36:54,412 --> 01:37:01,492
There's no number m such that all of the terms are less than m because it increases as much as it can.

1018
01:37:01,692 --> 01:37:02,511
It approaches infinity.

1019
01:37:02,511 --> 01:37:04,711
It has a lower bound.

1020
01:37:05,652 --> 01:37:09,912
